B.20. {d}en-lil₂ {d}iš-me-{d}da-gan dumu ki aŋ₂-za nam-lugal-la-a-na bal-bi ha-ra-su₃-ud#
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; Išmedagan[1]RN; dumu[child]; ki[place]; aŋ[measure]; namlugal[kingship]; bala[turn]; sud[distant]
#etcsl: line-id=B.20

